## Đề xuất gắn MIDI CC trong Studio One

### Auto-Tune Plugin
| App CC | Studio One Parameter | Cách gắn |
|--------|---------------------|----------|
| CC 33 (Key Root) | Auto-Tune → Key | MIDI Learn |
| CC 34 (Key Scale) | Auto-Tune → Scale (Maj/Min) | MIDI Learn |
| CC 35 (Scale Type) | Auto-Tune → Scale Type knob | MIDI Learn |
| CC 36 (Tune On/Off) | Auto-Tune → Bypass | MIDI Learn |

### Pitch Shifter Plugin
| App CC | Studio One Parameter | Cách gắn |
|--------|---------------------|----------|
| CC 10 (Tone Nhạc) | Pitch Shifter 1 → Semitone | MIDI Learn |
| CC 11 (Tone Giọng) | Pitch Shifter 2 → Semitone | MIDI Learn |

### Mixer / Channels
| App CC | Studio One Parameter | Cách gắn |
|--------|---------------------|----------|
| CC 20 (Mix Nhạc) | Track Nhạc → Volume Fader | Control Link → Global Map |
| CC 21 (Mix Mic) | Track Mic → Volume Fader | Control Link → Global Map |
| CC 22 (Mix Vang) | Reverb Send → Level | Control Link → Global Map |
| CC 23 (Mix Bè) | Track Bè → Volume Fader | Control Link → Global Map |
| CC 50-53 (Mute) | Track Mute buttons | Control Link → Global Map |
